OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASpecialist courts for rape cases to be
OL,4,Arolled out across England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will also be provided with private
OL,7,Fentrances and waiting rooms to separate
OL,8,Fthem from defendants, though it is
OL,9,Funderstood this will be dependent on
OL,10,Fthe architecture of each building.
OL,12,FRape Crisis England and Wales said this
OL,13,Fwas a "significant step forward" and
OL,14,Faddressed several reforms it had been
OL,15,Frequesting for many years.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
